plaintext
* SPICE Netlist

* Voltage source
Vi 3 0 DC

* Resistors
R1 3 2  R1_value
R2 2 77 R2_value
R3 2 5  R3_value
R4 4 5  R4_value

* Operational Amplifier
* In positive, in negative, out
XOPAMP 2 4 77 OPAMP_MODEL

* .MODEL OPAMP_MODEL and resistance values (R1_value, R2_value, R3_value, R4_value) 
* need to be defined elsewhere

.END